  ## Maximum sustainable yield
  
  
    * MSY is found when $N=K/2$
    * []
    * The maximum yield is $H = r_{max}K/4$
    * []
    * The optimal harvest rate is $h = r_{max}/2$
  




% Subtle point, This is all about density-dependence in reproduction!!!!!!!!






